+Lane B14 defines the settle boundary as the first poll that saw LOCKED, plus
+4.096 s, plus 0.5 s
+([B14, item 2](B14_BENCH_5603C353.md#item-2-source-switches-645-647)). No poll here
+read LOCKED, so no slip falls before or after it.
